  "notes": "{訓戒|くんかい} is a formal word for admonition or reprimand.\n\nUSAGE:\n- {訓戒|くんかい}する: to admonish, to reprimand (suru-verb)\n- {訓戒|くんかい}を{受|う}ける: to receive an admonition\n- {訓戒|くんかい}{処分|しょぶん}: disciplinary warning (official punishment category)\n\nREGISTER:\nFormal; used in official, workplace, or educational contexts.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {忠告|ちゅうこく}: advice, warning (less formal)\n- {戒|いまし}め: admonition, lesson\n- {叱責|しっせき}: rebuke, scolding",
